CUSTOM CPU INSTRUCTION SET - ASSEMBLY LANGUAGE TABLE
=====================================================
-- up to date --

🧮 INTEGER ARITHMETIC & LOGIC
-----------------------------
Mnemonic    Operands      Format            Description
--------    --------      ------            -----------
ADD         RA, RB        ADD Rn, Rn        Integer addition
SUB         RA, RB        SUB Rn, Rn        Integer subtraction
MULT        RA, RB        MULT Rn, Rn       Integer multiplication
DIV         RA, RB        DIV Rn, Rn        Integer division
MOD         RA, RB        MOD Rn, Rn        Modulo (RA % RB)
SHL             RB        SHL Rn            Shift left
SHR             RB        SHR Rn            Shift right
NOT             RB        NOT Rn            Bitwise NOT
AND         RA, RB        AND Rn, Rn        Bitwise AND
OR          RA, RB        OR Rn, Rn         Bitwise OR
XOR         RA, RB        XOR Rn, Rn        Bitwise XOR
++              RB        ++ Rn             Increment
--              RB        -- Rn             Decrement
NEG             RB        NEG Rn            Two's complement negate
CMP         RA, RB        CMP Rn, Rn        Compare, set flags
**Results are stored in R0**

