SHR.F           RB        SHR.F Rn          Float shift right (if valid)
FLOAT           RB        FLOAT Rn          Convert int to float
INT             RB        INT Rn            Convert float to int
++F             RB        ++F Rn            Float increment
--F             RB        --F Rn            Float decrement
NEG.F           RB        NEG.F Rn          Float negate
CMP.F       RA, RB        CMP.F Rn, Rn      Float compare
**Results are stored in R0**

